# Low Water: the voices in a fight and in a sneak (SYSTEMS-FULL 18.9, 17.1). Director, 2026-10-17.
# @bark: one line per situation key (combat/sim/barks.mjs BARK_KEYS); the voice is the rule's.
# @cue: an inner voice during a sneak (world/stealth.mjs); the first cue whose level holds speaks,
# so each situation has a high-level line first and a plainer one after it.
# Barks are one breath long and never explain the system; they say what the body or the nose knows.

@bark b.footing_frost
key: footing.frost
text: Frost under the left boot.

@bark b.footing_wet
key: footing.wet
text: Wet stone. The whole foot down, not the toe.

@bark b.breath_low
key: breath.low
text: Nothing left in the bellows. Step back and let them fill.

@bark b.tide_near
key: tide.near
text: Water at the ankle in twenty seconds.

@bark b.smell_behind
key: smell.behind
text: Eel-oil and fear. Behind you.

@bark b.tell_grab
key: tell.grab
text: He wants you to block.

@bark b.dark_near
key: dark.near
text: Breathing, close, where the light isn't.

@bark b.pride_losing
key: pride.losing
text: Wet to the knee and losing, and the whole quay can see the hat.

@bark b.footing_frost2
key: footing.frost
text: Ice. Short steps.

@bark b.footing_frost3
key: footing.frost
text: The stone has a skin of frost. Don't trust it.

@bark b.footing_wet2
key: footing.wet
text: Weed underfoot. It moves when you do.

@bark b.footing_wet3
key: footing.wet
text: Wet stone. It will take the feet first.

@bark b.breath_low2
key: breath.low
text: The chest is empty. Back off and breathe.

@bark b.breath_low3
key: breath.low
text: Two more swings and the knees will sit down by themselves.

@bark b.tide_near2
key: tide.near
text: The water's on the move. Feel it at the heel.

@bark b.tide_near3
key: tide.near
text: Sea's coming up the stones behind you.

@bark b.smell_behind2
key: smell.behind
text: Tar and pipe smoke. Behind, and close.

@bark b.smell_behind3
key: smell.behind
text: Somebody downwind of you who hasn't washed since the vote.

@bark b.tell_grab2
key: tell.grab
text: The weight's gone forward. They mean to take hold.

@bark b.tell_grab3
key: tell.grab
text: Never mind the face. The hands want your coat.

@bark b.dark_near2
key: dark.near
text: A boot on stone, an arm's length off.

@bark b.dark_near3
key: dark.near
text: Something in the dark has stopped moving. That's worse.

@bark b.pride_losing2
key: pride.losing
text: The hat is in the water. So, nearly, is the dignity.

@bark b.pride_losing3
key: pride.losing
text: Losing, and wet, and watched from the windows.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- the manner voices in a fight (they fill Composure)
@bark b.words_condolence
key: words.condolence
text: Hurt, and not saying so. They'd stop if somebody let them.

@bark b.words_formletter
key: words.formletter
text: The assessor has not struck. Note it. They will have to note it too.

@bark b.words_chit
key: words.chit
text: Every second you don't strike, they owe you one.

@bark b.words_hearsay
key: words.hearsay
text: Two of them, and both wondering who'll be blamed first.

@bark b.words_condolence2
key: words.condolence
text: Bleeding into a collar and calling it rain.

@bark b.words_condolence3
key: words.condolence
text: Nobody came out tonight wanting this. Say so.

@bark b.words_formletter2
key: words.formletter
text: Hands open, feet set. The Shelf is on record as declining to strike.

@bark b.words_formletter3
key: words.formletter
text: Let the minute pass in writing. Then speak.

@bark b.words_chit2
key: words.chit
text: Keep the guard up. The debt is running in your favour.

@bark b.words_chit3
key: words.chit
text: Restraint costs nothing now and buys a sentence later.

@bark b.words_hearsay2
key: words.hearsay
text: They're both looking at the quay. Somebody up there is watching.

@bark b.words_hearsay3
key: words.hearsay
text: The tall one wants to go home. The other one knows it.

@bark b.words_condolence4
key: words.condolence
text: Somebody at home is waiting up for that one.

@bark b.words_formletter4
key: words.formletter
text: Hold. Every second held is a line in the Shelf's favour.

@bark b.words_chit4
key: words.chit
text: Let them spend. You're the one with credit.

@bark b.words_hearsay4
key: words.hearsay
text: By morning the Gut will say the Shelf never raised a hand. Make it true.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- sneak voices
@cue c.turning.dark
on: turning
skill: dark
dc: 5
text: He's turning. Be a post. Posts don't breathe.

@cue c.turning
on: turning
skill: undertow
text: Don't move. Moving is what eyes are for.

@cue c.lantern.candlemas
on: lantern
skill: candlemas
dc: 3
text: You are holding the only yellow on this quay, darling. Everyone can read it.

@cue c.lantern
on: lantern
skill: dark
text: The lantern. Every eye out there just found you.

@cue c.close.smell
on: close
skill: smell
dc: 4
text: Tar and pipe smoke, an arm's length off. He hasn't seen you. He will if you swallow.

@cue c.close
on: close
skill: dark
text: Close enough to touch. Don't.

@cue c.wind.salt
on: wind
skill: salt
dc: 4
text: Wind's come round on the cheek. Your smell is going to him now.

@cue c.wind
on: wind
skill: smell
text: The wind has changed sides, and so has your smell.
